          "block_label": "display_formula",
          "block_content": " $$ \\begin{aligned}\\Delta\\theta&=f[\\mathrm{Ac-L-Trp}]_{\\mathrm{m}}\\\\&=f\\left\\{P e_{\\mathrm{A,app}}[\\mathrm{Ac-L-Trp}]+\\frac{K_{\\mathrm{S,app}}[\\mathrm{Site}]_{0}[\\mathrm{Ac-L-Trp}]}{1+K_{\\mathrm{S,app}}[\\mathrm{Ac-L-Trp}]}\\right\\}\\end{aligned} $$ ",
